{
  "_id": 110261,
  "id": "the_fluffy_handdrawn_storyboards",
  "name": "The Fluffy Hand-drawn Storyboards",
  "description": "Fluffy Across the Blue in its storyboard stage. Slightly increases the Traces of Elation characters.",
  "story": "Blurry is an incredibly fast artist who can draw a month's worth of work in a single day. But they never do, claiming they need to \"guarantee quality,\" though they're likely just allergic to work.\n\n\"It's so weird... how are there so many identical manuscripts of 'The Fluffy' out there, and every single one is clearly an original? Is Blurry selling these to make a quick buck?\"\n\"No way! Blurry is just a perfectionist who draws every page ten times until it's exactly right.\"",
